 "chat_messages": [
  {
   "id": 171,
   "session_id": "49",
   "user_id": 44,
   "role": "user",
   "content": "什么是逆矩阵？怎么求？",
   "mode": "detailed",
   "citations": "",
   "rag_used": 0,
   "ocr_used": 0,
   "image_url": "",
   "created": "2026-08-17T22:08:54.608982"
  },
  {
   "id": 172,
   "session_id": "49",
   "user_id": 44,
   "role": "assistant",
   "content": "## 逆矩阵的定义\n\n对于 $n$ 阶方阵 $A$，若存在 $n$ 阶方阵 $B$ 使得 $AB = BA = E$，则称 $A$ **可逆**，$B$ 是 $A$ 的逆矩阵，记作 $A^{-1}$。\n\n## 求法\n\n1. **定义法**：$B = \\dfrac{A^*}{|A|}$，其中 $A^*$ 是伴随矩阵\n2. **初等变换法**：$[A | E] \\to [E | A^{-1}]$\n3. **特征值法**：若 $A = P \\Lambda P^{-1}$，则 $A^{-1} = P \\Lambda^{-1} P^{-1}$\n\n## 关键公式\n\n$$A^{-1} = \\frac{1}{\\det(A)} \\cdot \\text{adj}(A)$$\n\n## 例题\n\n求 $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 \\\\\\end{bmatrix}$ 的逆矩阵。\n\n解：$\\det(A) = -2$，伴随矩阵 $\\text{adj}(A) = \\begin{bmatrix} 4 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 1 \\\\end{bmatrix}$\n\n$$A^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} -2 & 1 \\\\ \\tfrac{3}{2} & -\\tfrac{1}{2} \\\\\\end{bmatrix}$$",
   "mode": "detailed",
   "citations": "",
   "rag_used": 0,
   "ocr_used": 0,
   "image_url": "",
   "created": "2026-08-17T22:08:54.608982"
  },
  {
   "id": 173,
   "session_id": "49",
   "user_id": 44,
   "role": "user",
   "content": "特征值的几何意义是什么？",
   "mode": "detailed",
   "citations": "",
   "rag_used": 0,
   "ocr_used": 0,
   "image_url": "",
   "created": "2026-08-17T22:08:54.608982"
  },
  {
   "id": 174,
   "session_id": "49",
   "user_id": 44,
   "role": "assistant",
   "content": "## 直观理解\n\n特征值 $\\lambda$ 告诉你：**线性变换 $A$ 在某些方向上只是\"拉伸/压缩\"**，没有旋转。\n\n## 严格定义\n\n$A\\mathbf{v} = \\lambda \\mathbf{v}$，其中 $\\mathbf{v} \\ne \\mathbf{0}$。\n\n## 几何意义\n\n- $|\\lambda| > 1$：拉伸\n- $|\\lambda| < 1$：压缩\n- $\\lambda < 0$：反向\n\n## 关键公式\n\n$$\\det(\\lambda E - A) = 0$$",
   "mode": "detailed",
   "citations": "",
   "rag_used": 0,
   "ocr_used": 0,
   "image_url": "",
   "created": "2026-08-17T22:08:54.608982"
  },
  {
   "id": 175,
   "session_id": "50",
   "user_id": 44,
   "role": "user",
   "content": "行列式有什么几何意义？",
   "mode": "detailed",
   "citations": "",
   "rag_used": 0,
   "ocr_used": 0,
   "image_url": "",
   "created": "2026-08-17T22:08:54.608982"
  },
  {
   "id": 176,
   "session_id": "50",
   "user_id": 44,
   "role": "assistant",
   "content": "## 几何意义\n\n**$n$ 阶行列式的绝对值 = 由其行向量张成的 $n$ 维平行多面体的体积。**\n\n## 二维情形\n\n$|\\det\\begin{bmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\\\end{bmatrix}| = $ 平行四边形面积\n\n## 关键意义\n\n- $\\det A = 0$ ⇔ 向量共面/共线 ⇔ 体积=0 ⇔ 矩阵不可逆\n- $\\det(AB) = \\det A \\cdot \\det B$",
   "mode": "detailed",
   "citations": "",
   "rag_used": 0,
   "ocr_used": 0,
   "image_url": "",
   "created": "2026-08-17T22:08:54.608982"
  },
  {
